  "method": "Exact DGUID/CDUID join. Source EPSG:3347 transformed to EPSG:4326, exported coordinates rounded to 5 decimals. Shapely topology-preserving simplification: 600 m south of representative-point latitude 60 N; 3000 m north. Polygon parts and holes smaller than tolerance squared omitted; largest component always retained. Area conversion for this display-only omission: 12,364,000,000 * cos(latitude) square metres per square degree. Full-CD statistics even when the viewport clips a polygon. No area-derived counts. Profile total-count SYMBOL is column 12, not repeated rate/sex SYMBOL columns. Missing remains null; published zero remains zero.",
